{"id":"n66649-5-4","stage":1,"title":"사랑 · 爱人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66649-5-4-1","ko":"내 사랑은 대체 어디에 있는 걸까?","zh":"我的爱人到底在哪里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사랑은","meaning":"爱人","explanation":"사랑：爱人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사랑","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66649","senseId":"5","lemma":"사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸까?","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ff2763f11c21f167","term":"사랑","zh":"爱人","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3","entryId":"66649","definition":"非常喜欢和珍惜的人。","pronunciation":["사랑"]},{"id":"baa66ff689021a3f","term":"대체","zh":"到底、究竟","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3","definition":"用于疑问句，加强追问或惊讶的语气。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ee1dc5cec2227f6823b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66649-5-4-2","ko":"곧 너의 좋은 짝이 나타날 거야.","zh":"很快就会有个适合你的人出现啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너의","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，吉","explanation":"좋다：好，吉；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"9","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짝이","meaning":"对象，另一半","explanation":"짝：对象，另一半；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짝","audio":"/audio/8760c9cd24ebf64d2fd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37141","senseId":"2","lemma":"짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타날","meaning":"出现","explanation":"나타나다：出现；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{